  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AL: Harnessing Big Data and Machine Learning for Feed the Future (under Innovative M&amp;E APS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Bureau For Food Security (BFS)):  Purpose: .The project will combine the latest advances in satellite vegetation remote sensing and crowd-sourced food price data, processed using cutting-edge machine learning and time series estimation techniques, to provide a more accurate, timely, and lower cost monitoring of key Feed the Future (FtF) outcome indicators..Activities: .This project is the integration of a diverse array of novel, open source data from satellite remote sensing, household surveys, census, and spot food market prices for the purpose of poverty and malnutrition prediction via machine learning and time series estimation techniques. Activities will be conducted centrally....</narrative>
  </description>
